      "side": 1,
      "message": "`tcpci_emul_set_vbus_voltage` bases its use of EXT_STATUS on the value of PD_INTERFACE_REV (correctly). This test appears to base its expected driver behavior on `tcpc_config.flags`, and I don\u0027t see code to make the emulator actually do this behavior.\n\nDoes the test need to be updated to ensure the correct emulator behavior at the correct time?",
